# i3 config file (v4)
#
# Please see https://i3wm.org/docs/userguide.html for a complete reference!
#
# Shared config lives in conf.d/: baseconfig.conf (appearance, bindings,
# workspaces) and autostart.conf (startup programs + the workspace assignments
# that route them). Each conf.d file is self-contained, so include order
# doesn't matter.
#
# Machine-specific config comes from machines/<role>/i3/*.conf in the env repo.
# i3 expands include paths with wordexp(3), so $MACHINE_ROLE (exported by
# ~/.xprofile from ~/.config/machine-role.env) picks the directory. A pattern
# that matches nothing is skipped without error, but every role directory
# still ships at least one .conf so the include always resolves.

include conf.d/*.conf
include $HOME/src/env/machines/$MACHINE_ROLE/i3/*.conf
